<title>USA: FPA Medical, AHI Healthcare file proxy.</title>
<headline>FPA Medical, AHI Healthcare file proxy.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>FPA Medical Management Inc and AHI Healthcare Systems Inc said on Tuesday they have filed a joint proxy statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission related to their proposed merger.</p>
<p>FPA Medical and AHI Healthcare said they expect the merger, valued at about $130 million, to close in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
